      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是最近該說是低潮期嗎？\n總覺得表現不太好，靈感都冒不出來……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F67008FD18A728AAA662F4F4E6F6E671F55CEFF1F000A7E3D89BA5F97886873FE4E0D592A597DFF0C9748611F90FD51924E0D51FA4F862026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我想要一點刺激！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n能帶給我靈感，而且是因為\n變化而產生的刺激……那就是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621160F389814E009EDE523A6FC0FF0100100001BE01000A80FD5E367D6662119748611FFF0C800C4E14662F56E070BA000A8B8A5316800C7522751F7684523A6FC02026202690A35C31662F2026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級進化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A90325316FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為超級進化而產生的變化！\n我想看超級進化帶來的力量提升！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA8D857D1A90325316800C7522751F76848B8A5316FF01000A621160F3770B8D857D1A903253165E364F867684529B91CF63D05347FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我特別想看超級噴火駝的爆發\n來讓自己靈光乍現一下！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117279522560F3770B8D857D1A5674706B99DD76847206767C000A4F868B9381EA5DF1974851494E4D73FE4E004E0BFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！和我對戰\n讓我看看超級噴火駝吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01548C62115C0D6230000A8B936211770B770B8D857D1A5674706B99DD5427FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
