      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色隱形眼鏡的顏色選項\n追加了熊熊燃燒和心醉神迷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827296B15F62773C93E17684984F827290789805000A8FFD52A04E86718A718A71C371D2548C5FC39189795E8FF730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色隱形眼鏡的進化……\n這正是「超級鏡化」啊～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827296B15F62773C93E176849032531620262026000A90196B63662F300C8D857D1A93E15316300D554AFF5EFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能看到其他的超級進化，\n感覺我就能做出新款的彩色隱形眼鏡了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果要更換彩色隱形眼鏡，\n就從選單用<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus選擇「換裝／化妝」，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n接著用<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZR移動到「化妝」吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
